## Notes

- Browser cookies are read locally; never ask the user to paste cookies into chat.
- Do not store cookie, token, or ticket values in repository files.
- Prefer minimal, targeted calls; validate with `doctor` after auth errors.
- Use `--verbose` only when debugging latency; use `--include-raw` only when diagnosing API shape.
